OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and bright at first for
OL,6,Fall, but turning increasingly cloudy
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fthen spread east during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning heavy for a time. Becoming
OL,10,Frather windy with gales along
OL,11,Fnorthwestern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA rather cloudy night follows
OL,14,Fwith the rain easing and turning dry
OL,15,Ffor a time. Remaining rather windy,
OL,16,Fkeeping the temperatures from falling
OL,17,Faway.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
