OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA rather cloudy day for all
OL,6,Fon Saturday with a little patchy rain
OL,7,Fat times. Winds easing and turning
OL,8,Fdrier towards the evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry but
OL,11,Frather cloudy on Sunday with some
OL,12,Fovernight rain. Rather cloudy on
OL,13,FMonday and Tuesday with some sunny
OL,14,Fspells and lighter winds and turning a
OL,15,Flittle warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
